The Spot + Kortex URDF and mesh files in this directory are derived from the
following local ROS packages:

  CHAMP Spot description
  https://github.com/chvmp/spot_ros
  Revision ff6cf1def44624565a838db99e08b342ba009f2f
  The upstream spot_description/package.xml declares the package as BSD.

  Kinova Gen3 7-DOF description
  https://github.com/Kinovarobotics/ros_kortex
  Copyright (c) 2018, Kinova inc.
  Revision c3280d8a6a6b5d96590d51538e3f265710a6c77d
  Distributed under the BSD 3-Clause License in LICENSE.kortex.

The composite body-to-mount and mount-to-arm transforms follow the ScorpioX
spot_kortex.urdf.xacro definition from:

  https://github.com/Liyunong20000/heterogeneous_robot.git
  Revision 4e296e1fbef17a4399c0914cd69af5808beb089f

For reinforcement learning, the generated URDF omits ROS/Gazebo plugins,
transmissions, sensors, and the Robotiq gripper.  The four continuous Gen3
joints are represented by revolute joints with +/- 2*pi limits so reset and
joint-limit terms have finite ranges.  Geometry and inertial parameters remain
from the referenced robot descriptions.
